{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09475","headline":"萼绿华歌 · 韦应物","name":"萼绿华歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有一人兮昇紫霞，书名玉牒兮蕚绿华。\n仙容矫矫兮杂瑶佩，轻衣重重兮蒙绦纱。\n云雨愁思兮望淮海，鼓吹萧条兮驾龙车。\n世淫浊兮不可降，胡不来兮玉斧家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09475.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09475","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}